! edge — AS65100  (Arista EOS)
!
! Enterprise edge router:
!   - eBGP to ISP (AS65500): receives default route + 1.1.1.1/32
!   - OSPF area 0 to cc1 and cc2: distributes default route into campus
!   - Loopback0 used as OSPF router-id
!
! Links:
!   Ethernet1: 203.0.113.2/30  (to isp)
!   Ethernet2: 10.0.12.1/30   (to cc1)
!   Ethernet3: 10.0.22.1/30   (to cc2)
!   Loopback0: 10.0.0.2/32
!
hostname edge
!
interface Loopback0
   ip address 10.0.0.2/32
!
interface Ethernet1
   description to-isp  203.0.113.0/30
   no switchport
   ip address 203.0.113.2/30
   no shutdown
!
interface Ethernet2
   description to-cc1  10.0.12.0/30
   no switchport
   ip address 10.0.12.1/30
   no shutdown
!
interface Ethernet3
   description to-cc2  10.0.22.0/30
   no switchport
   ip address 10.0.22.1/30
   no shutdown
!
ip routing
!
! ================================================
! edge  —  Capstone Tasks
!
! Role: Enterprise edge router — OSPF to campus + eBGP to ISP
!
! Task 1 — OSPF Area 0
!   Activate Ethernet2/3 (internal links), keep Ethernet1 (WAN) passive.
!   Inject a default route into OSPF so cc1/cc2 and hosts have internet access.
!   Hint:
!     router ospf 1
!        router-id 10.0.0.2
!        passive-interface default
!        no passive-interface Ethernet2
!        no passive-interface Ethernet3
!        default-information originate always
!        network 10.0.0.2/32 area 0.0.0.0
!        network 10.0.12.0/30 area 0.0.0.0
!        network 10.0.22.0/30 area 0.0.0.0
!
! Task 2 — eBGP to ISP (AS65500)
!   Peer with 203.0.113.1, advertise loopback 10.0.0.2/32, receive default.
!   Hint:
!     router bgp 65100
!        router-id 10.0.0.2
!        no bgp ebgp-requires-policy
!        neighbor 203.0.113.1 remote-as 65500
!        neighbor 203.0.113.1 description isp
!        address-family ipv4
!           neighbor 203.0.113.1 activate
!           network 10.0.0.2/32
! ================================================
!
end
